<title>SOUTH KOREA: Two S.Korean firms buy 22,500T of U.S. wheat.</title>
<headline>Two S.Korean firms buy 22,500T of U.S. wheat.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two South Korean flour mills, Dongah Flour Mills Co Ltd and Cheiljedang Corp, bought on Thursday a total of 22,500 tonnes of U.S. No. 1 wheat from Japanese trading house Mitsubishi Corp, traders said.</p>
</text>
